From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:52:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(profiler): isolate writable KV blocks in real-row
 engine grid


Isolate writable KV blocks per request during real-row profiling so
concurrent synthetic profiling rows cannot corrupt shared KV cache pages.

Upstream-base: 19f2c20ed4d64ae22bd009ceacadd85e2a81e354
Rationale: Eliminate cross-request KV aliasing in real-row profiling.
Quality: Exact order-independent torch.equal parity.
Tests: 6/6 GPU isolation tests in PR #1270.
Upstream-status: Local V1 profiler correctness fix.
